# database/users.json and data/fleet_today.json are intentionally
# KEPT in version control: they're the documented demo account
# (password "TestPass123!", meant to be changed, see README) and a
# real historical dataset, not secrets. This is what makes `git clone
# && pip install -r requirements.txt && python app.py` work immediately
# without any credentials. Once you add real accounts and a live
# import replaces this file, feel free to start ignoring them.
